"╭ ╭ Keys (vim) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Room list (continued)                          │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     j           Next room                         │ │"
"│▌│  Alt-←       Go to the room list               k           Previous room                     │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               g           First room                        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                G           Last room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                l           Messages                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         i           Composer                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          /           Find in this room                 │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                         Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     Del         Delete (own messages)             │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-U       Jump to first unread              p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       m           Menu for the message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-O       Filter: Unread only               End         Jump to newest                    │ │"
"│ │  Alt-D       Filter: People only               ?           This help                         │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       j           Newer message, then composer      │─╮"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          k           Select older message              │ │"
"╰─│  F3          Next theme                        g           Jump to oldest                    │─╯"
" ●╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ↑↓ scroll · Esc to close ╯k "
